      "method": "Paired design, 24 measured pairs per timed cell, interval [r(7), r(18)] of the paired log ratios (97.73 %); margins: time 10 %, tail 25 %, throughput 10 %, memory 20 %. K4 and L4 are deterministic allocator counts, one run per arm.",
